# Platform Guidelines

Purpose: per-platform behavior for HOSSPI HMS on all enabled Flutter targets.

## Mandatory rules

- Support Android, iOS, Web, Windows, macOS, Linux where enabled.
- Platform checks only at infrastructure boundaries, not throughout feature UI.
- Web: URLs, refresh, keyboard/pointer, storage limits.
- Desktop: resizable windows, menu bar, side nav, shortcuts, hover.
- Mobile: touch, safe areas, keyboard insets, back behavior.
- Smartwatch layouts out of scope.

## Build hosts

- iOS/macOS builds require macOS host with Apple tooling.
- Windows/Linux builds require matching host tooling.
- CI may split platform builds across OS images.

